  "雾化": "Fog",
  "缩放": "Zoom",
  "玻璃色相": "Glass hue",
  "着色": "Tint",
  "透明度": "Transparency",
  "磨砂": "Frost",
  "选择壁纸": "Choose wallpaper",
  "＋ 添加壁纸": "+ Add wallpaper",
  "随机轮换 · 开": "Shuffle · on",
  "随机轮换 · 关": "Shuffle · off",
